    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it all go\"... what does that even mean? you say it like it's this peaceful thing, like i'll just find some closure or something. but it feels more like there's just nothing left to hold onto. if the person i was is dead, then why am i still taking up space? it feels so much more logical to just finish the job and stop pretending i'm still here. i don't see how anything changes this.",
